      "why_it_failed": "The current engine supports only one bounded message-task family: `receiveTask` waits for exactly one message binding through `messageRef` or one nested `messageEventDefinition`, and `sendTask` dispatches exactly one message binding through that same bounded source shape. Script execution, correlations, and broader collaboration-aware routing remain outside the slice.",
